'''''Stachys ocymastrum''''', the '''Italian hedgenettle''', is a species of annual herb in the family [[Lamiaceae]]. They have a self-supporting growth form. Flowers are visited by [[Green-striped white|Green-striped White]]. Individuals can grow to 0.4 m.<ref>{{Cite web|title=Stachys ocymastrum (L.) Briq. - Encyclopedia of Life|url=https://eol.org/pages/485214|access-date=2022-02-04|website=eol.org}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |last=Mifsud |first=Stephen |date=2002-08-23 |title=Stachys ocymastrum (Hairy Woundwort) : MaltaWildPlants.com - the online Flora of the Maltese Islands. |url=https://www.maltawildplants.com/LABT/Stachys_ocymastrum.php |access-date=2022-03-07 |website=www.maltawildplants.com |language=en-us}}</ref>


